16023 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(Three horizontal lanes. Fresher: degree, course or self-study, then projects and a portfolio, then an internship or entry analyst role; advantage, time to build skills from zero; obstacle, no work evidence yet. Career switcher: experience in another field such as finance, sales or operations, then tier 1 keys plus projects on your own domain, then a domain analyst role such as finance analyst; advantage, business context employers value; obstacle, less time and starting over feels risky. Internal move: a job inside a company such as sales, support or operations, then automating your own work and volunteering analysis, then an internal opening or a role reshaped around you; advantage, people already trust you; obstacle, being seen as only your old job.)/P 777 0 R/Pg 665 0 R/K 48>>
endobj

