17547 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A combined chart for weeks 1 to 12, with its two scales named at the top: bars for practice minutes per week, a line for the weekly check score out of 10. The bars rise from 180 minutes to 270 by week 7, then sit around 240 to 250. The line reads 3, 4, 5, 6, then stays at 6 through weeks 5 to 8, then 7, 8, 8, 9. Weeks 5 to 8 are shaded and labeled: plateau, weeks 5 to 8, score stuck at 6. A note under week 8 says: from week 8, harder problems on her own questions, reviewed weekly.)/P 777 0 R/Pg 719 0 R/K 75>>
endobj

